    text: "You're Invited: Northfield Home & Garden Expo\n\nMark your calendar for the Northfield Home & Garden Expo, taking place September 18-20 at the Northfield Convention Center. This year's expo will {1} over 150 exhibitors showcasing the latest products in landscaping, interior design, and home renovation.\n\nIn addition to browsing exhibitor booths, visitors can attend free workshops led by professional designers {2} offer practical tips for small-space gardening and budget-friendly home makeovers. {3}\n\nAdmission is $10 for adults, and children under 12 are admitted free of charge when accompanied by an adult. Tickets purchased online in advance are slightly cheaper {4} tickets purchased at the door, so we encourage early booking.\n\nWe look forward to seeing you there!",
