    text: "Dear Valued Clients,\n\nWe are writing to inform you that Hartley & Associates will be relocating its offices {1} the end of this month. Our new address will be 480 Riverside Boulevard, Suite 300, just two blocks from our current location.\n\nThis move will allow us to accommodate our growing team and offer clients a more comfortable meeting space. All phone numbers and email addresses will remain unchanged, {2} you will not need to update your contact records for us. {3}\n\nOur offices will be closed on Friday, March 27, to allow the moving crew to complete the transition, and we will reopen at the new location on Monday, March 30. We appreciate your patience and understanding during this transition and look forward to welcoming you to our new space.\n\nIf you have any questions in the {4}, please do not hesitate to contact our office manager, Ms. Patel.",
