    text: "System Maintenance Notice\n\nDear GreenBank Online Banking Users,\n\nTo continue improving the security and performance of our online banking platform, we will be performing scheduled maintenance beginning at 11:00 P.M. on Saturday, April 4, and {1} at approximately 5:00 A.M. on Sunday, April 5.\n\nDuring this window, online banking, the mobile app, and our customer service chat will be temporarily {2}. Automatic bill payments and scheduled transfers will not be affected and will process as usual. {3}\n\nWe recommend completing any urgent transactions before the maintenance window begins. If you experience any issues accessing your account after the maintenance is complete, please clear your browser cache or update the mobile app to the {4} version before contacting support.\n\nThank you for your patience as we work to enhance your banking experience.",
