    { s: "W", text: "This is a perfect chance to stock up on strawberries, apples, and seasonal melons.", jtext: "イチゴ、リンゴ、旬のメロンをまとめ買いする絶好の機会です。", audio: "t2_l2.mp3" },
    { s: "W", text: "Also, please remember that our store will close thirty minutes earlier than usual this evening.", jtext: "また、本日の夕方は当店が通常より30分早く閉店いたしますので、ご了承ください。", audio: "t2_l3.mp3" },
    { s: "W", text: "If you need any help finding an item, our friendly staff are happy to assist you. Thank you for shopping with us.", jtext: "商品をお探しの際は、親切なスタッフが喜んでお手伝いいたします。ご来店ありがとうございます。", audio: "t2_l4.mp3" }
